# Apps Script source files contain live API tokens (Tamara Bearer JWT,
# Daftra API key, PayPal Live Secret, Anthropic). NEVER commit to the
# public malearnsa repo. Source of truth = Google Apps Script (deployed
# via clasp from ~/code/.clasp-token-validator/). The paths below are
# local-only working mirrors.
